					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I choose to believe this, and it makes the article a lot more enjoyable for me.</p> <p>That being said, I like this quite a bit, even if we have more modern or more in-depth examples. The fact that it's so huge and refreshes often enough that we need to look at it daily (even throwing us memetic kill agents) gives it just enough to make it more than &quot;hard drive from another universe&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
